  {
   "id": "promenade-181162@post-2023-10-24",
   "gameId": "promenade-181162",
   "displayName": "[Demo updated] - Boss reworked",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2023-10-24T14:04:45.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone !",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, thanks a lot ! We read your comments and it was very helpful and heartwarming !",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You seemed to really enjoy what the demo have to offer but some of you were not big fans of the boss fight. That's why we decided to go back and rework the boss fight to make it more interesting and less finicky. If you want to give it a try and give us some feedback, that would help us a lot !",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also fixed some minor bugs that found their way into the demo 😅. Like the crash that sometimes happened when loading a new savefile.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To all the people that played the demo or put the game in their whishlist : Thank you ! It helps us a lot 😊",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Holy Cap Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
